      "audioText": "Hi Mia! I haven't heard from you for ages, so I thought I'd write.",
      "audioMode": "tts",
      "languageCode": "en",
      "patternId": "n5-friends-banter-4"
    },
    {
      "id": "en.n5.class-44.t02",
      "en": "What have you been up to lately? Any news?",
      "es": "¿Qué has hecho últimamente? ¿Alguna novedad?",
      "explanationEs": "Lately = últimamente; Any news? es una elipsis de Have you got any news?",
      "segments": [
        "What have you been up",
        "to lately? Any news?"
      ],
      "audioText": "What have you been up to lately? Any news?",
